TITLE 1D transport with cation exchange (10 cells, 10 shifts)

SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -correct_disp true
    -time_step 1
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -print_cells 4
    -print_frequency 1
END
